  &lt;ul&gt;
- &lt;li&gt;
- The calculation of the length of a line takes into account the number of
- expanded spaces for a tab character (&lt;code&gt;'\t'&lt;/code&gt;). The default number of spaces is &lt;code&gt;8&lt;/code&gt;.
- To specify a different number of spaces, the user can set
- &lt;a href="https://checkstyle.org/config.html#Checker"&gt;&lt;code&gt;Checker&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
- property &lt;code&gt;tabWidth&lt;/code&gt; which applies to all Checks, including &lt;code&gt;LineLength&lt;/code&gt;;
- or can set property &lt;code&gt;tabWidth&lt;/code&gt; for &lt;code&gt;LineLength&lt;/code&gt; alone.
- &lt;/li&gt;
- &lt;li&gt;
- By default, package and import statements (lines matching pattern &lt;code&gt;^(package|import) .*&lt;/code&gt;)
- are not verified by this check.
- &lt;/li&gt;
- &lt;li&gt;
- Trailing comments are taken into consideration while calculating the line length.
- &lt;div class="wrapper"&gt;&lt;pre class="prettyprint"&gt;&lt;code&gt;
+   &lt;li&gt;Notes: The calculation of the length of a line takes into account the number of expanded
+       spaces for a tab character (&lt;code&gt;'\t'&lt;/code&gt;). The default number of spaces is &lt;code&gt;8&lt;/code&gt;. To
+       specify a different number of spaces, the user can set &lt;a
+       href="https://checkstyle.org/config.html#Checker"&gt;&lt;code&gt;Checker&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; property &lt;code&gt;tabWidth&lt;/code&gt; which applies to all Checks, including &lt;code&gt;LineLength&lt;/code&gt;; or can set property
+       &lt;code&gt;tabWidth&lt;/code&gt; for &lt;code&gt;LineLength&lt;/code&gt; alone.
+   &lt;li&gt;By default, package and import statements (lines matching pattern &lt;code&gt;^(package|import).*&lt;/code&gt;) are not verified by this check.
+   &lt;li&gt;Trailing comments are taken into consideration while calculating the line length.
